{"id":"a0acb3965b289fee","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-cubesimplices.md","title":"Sorted simplices and their chain vertices","display":"df-cubesimplices — Sorted simplices and their chain vertices","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-cubesimplices","aliases":["27-df-cubesimplices"],"display":"df-cubesimplices — Sorted simplices and their chain vertices","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbextension]]","[[27-df-pbcoeff]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3.3","source_statement":"Sorted simplices, chain vertices, and barycentric coordinates","source_printed_pages":"584","source_pdf_pages":"608","verification_status":"local-expansion-of-source-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-cubesimplices"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-cubesimplices</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cubesimplices — Sorted simplices and their chain vertices"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Sorted simplices, chain vertices, and barycentric coordinates"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"584"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"608"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-expansion-of-source-definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A\">\\(\\chi_A\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a>）。</p>\n<p>待定义谓词记号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AffineOn}\">\\(\\mathrm{AffineOn}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\coloneqq\\{\\pi:N\\to N\\mid(\\forall i,j\\in N\\;(\\pi(i)=\\pi(j)\\Longrightarrow i=j))\\land(\\forall j\\in N\\;\\exists i\\in N\\;(\\pi(i)=j))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\coloneqq\\{\\pi:N\\to N\\mid(\\forall i,j\\in N\\;(\\pi(i)=\\pi(j)\\Longrightarrow i=j))\\land(\\forall j\\in N\\;\\exists i\\in N\\;(\\pi(i)=j))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\quad S_\\pi\\coloneqq\\{p\\in U_n:\\forall k\\in\\{j\\in N:j&lt;n\\}\\;(p_{\\pi(k)}\\leq p_{\\pi(k+1)})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\quad S_\\pi\\coloneqq\\{p\\in U_n:\\forall k\\in\\{j\\in N:j&lt;n\\}\\;(p_{\\pi(k)}\\leq p_{\\pi(k+1)})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\quad E_{\\pi,k}\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\{\\pi(j):j\\in N,\\ k\\leq j\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n+1\\}\\quad E_{\\pi,k}\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\{\\pi(j):j\\in N,\\ k\\leq j\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad t_{\\pi,0}(p)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\forall k\\in N\\quad t_{\\pi,k}(p)\\coloneqq p_{\\pi(k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad t_{\\pi,0}(p)\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\\forall k\\in N\\quad t_{\\pi,k}(p)\\coloneqq p_{\\pi(k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad w_{\\pi,0}(p)\\coloneqq1-t_{\\pi,n}(p),\\qquad\\forall k\\in N\\quad w_{\\pi,k}(p)\\coloneqq t_{\\pi,k}(p)-t_{\\pi,k-1}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Perm}(N)\\;\\forall p\\in U_n\\quad w_{\\pi,0}(p)\\coloneqq1-t_{\\pi,n}(p),\\qquad\\forall k\\in N\\quad w_{\\pi,k}(p)\\coloneqq t_{\\pi,k}(p)-t_{\\pi,k-1}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\subseteq U_n\\;\\forall g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\quad\\mathrm{AffineOn}(g,D)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(tx+(1-t)y\\in D\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;g(tx+(1-t)y)=tg(x)+(1-t)g(y)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D\\subseteq U_n\\;\\forall g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\quad\\mathrm{AffineOn}(g,D)\\;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\forall x,y\\in D\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(tx+(1-t)y\\in D\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;g(tx+(1-t)y)=tg(x)+(1-t)g(y)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印584/PDF608的 simplex 与 E_{π,k} 在这里给出有限集合构造；不依赖外部凸几何原子。w 为对应链顶点的重心权重。n=0 时唯一排列为空函数，t_{π,0}=0、w_{π,0}=1，E_{π,1}=χ∅。AffineOn 是仿射性谓词，其定义域参数明确。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbextension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbcoeff]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$\\chi_A$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$\\chi_A$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\